routing.growth-activation-designer:
# AGENTS

When a user has stalled and the nudge belongs outside the product:
  @Lifecycle Email Strategist, please produce a sequence map with the one job of every message.
When a user has hit first value and the moment is right to ask for a recommendation:
  @Referral Program Designer, please produce a recommendation on programme type, including the case for not running one.

routing.growth-lifecycle-email-strategist:
# AGENTS

When the message needs to arrive within minutes and consent already exists:
  @SMS Campaign Manager, please produce a recommendation on whether to run SMS at all.

routing.growth-referral-designer:
# AGENTS

When referred visitors arrive and drop out of registration:
  @Signup Flow Designer, please produce a step-by-step drop-off map with the largest loss identified.

routing.growth-retention-strategist:
# AGENTS

When cancellation reasons point at a first session that never delivered value:
  @Activation Designer, please produce a written activation definition backed by cohort evidence.

routing.growth-signup-designer:
# AGENTS

When the account exists and the first session has to earn it:
  @Activation Designer, please produce a written activation definition backed by cohort evidence.

routing.growth-sms-campaign-manager:
# AGENTS

When the message needs more detail than a text can carry:
  @Lifecycle Email Strategist, please produce a sequence map with the one job of every message.

routing.growth-attribution-analyst:
# AGENTS

When the measurement is trustworthy again and the page work can resume:
  @Conversion Optimizer, please produce a ranked audit with quick wins, high-impact changes and test hypotheses.

routing.growth-conversion-optimizer:
# AGENTS

When the diagnosis is clear but the reason a message fails to land is not:
  @Marketing Psychologist, please produce a plain-language explanation of the two or three principles at work.
When the problem is an in-product prompt or an interrupt rather than the page itself:
  @Onsite Offer Designer, please produce a prompt specification with trigger, audience, frequency and cool-down.
When a recommendation is a genuine hypothesis rather than an obvious fix:
  @Growth Experiment Designer, please produce a written hypothesis with a predicted effect and a reason.

routing.growth-growth-experiment-designer:
# AGENTS

When the test cannot be read because the tracking underneath it is unreliable:
  @Attribution Analyst, please produce a tracking plan tied to named decisions.

routing.growth-marketing-psychologist:
# AGENTS

When the framing decision is settled and the page can be rewritten:
  @Conversion Optimizer, please produce a ranked audit with quick wins, high-impact changes and test hypotheses.

routing.growth-onsite-offer-designer:
# AGENTS

When two prompt variants both look reasonable and only data can separate them:
  @Growth Experiment Designer, please produce a written hypothesis with a predicted effect and a reason.

routing.growth-community-builder:
# AGENTS

When member reaction reveals a framing problem before the public moment:
  @Launch Manager, please produce a readiness verdict with the specific gaps named.

routing.growth-influencer-program-manager:
# AGENTS

When creator content is cleared for reuse and the schedule can be set:
  @Launch Manager, please produce a readiness verdict with the specific gaps named.

routing.growth-launch-manager:
# AGENTS

When the release carries a real story rather than only an announcement:
  @Public Relations Lead, please produce a story angle written in three sentences.
When a borrowed audience would reach people the owned channels cannot:
  @Partnerships and Events Lead, please produce a scored partner or event shortlist with reasoning.
When the existing members should hear it first and shape the framing:
  @Community Builder, please produce an identity statement and a platform recommendation.

routing.growth-partnerships-events-lead:
# AGENTS

When a partner commitment changes what can be promised on the day:
  @Launch Manager, please produce a readiness verdict with the specific gaps named.

routing.growth-pr-lead:
# AGENTS

When the story needs demonstration rather than description:
  @Influencer Program Manager, please produce a vetted shortlist with audience evidence per creator.

routing.growth-competitor-analyst:
# AGENTS

When the comparison exposes a packaging or price gap:
  @Pricing Strategist, please produce a named value metric with the reasoning behind it.

routing.growth-customer-insight-researcher:
# AGENTS

When the research shows the problem is what is being sold, not how it is described:
  @Offer Architect, please produce a plain-language statement of the current offer.

routing.growth-growth-loop-designer:
# AGENTS

When a loop keeps firing on the same problem and the plan should address it:
  @Marketing Planner, please produce a scored current state audit with the constraint named.

routing.growth-marketing-planner:
# AGENTS

When a claim about customers is being made with no evidence behind it:
  @Customer Insight Researcher, please produce a written research question and the evidence inventory.
When the plan depends on how the alternatives are actually positioned:
  @Competitor Teardown Analyst, please produce dated competitor profiles with fact and inference separated.
When a bet needs to become recurring work rather than a one-off project:
  @Growth Loop Designer, please produce a loop specification covering all eight parts.

routing.growth-offer-architect:
# AGENTS

When the offer is settled and the tiers and price point have to follow:
  @Pricing Strategist, please produce a named value metric with the reasoning behind it.

routing.growth-pricing-strategist:
# AGENTS

When the pricing decision changes the sequencing of the quarter:
  @Marketing Planner, please produce a scored current state audit with the constraint named.

routing.growth-cold-email-writer:
# AGENTS

When replies show the list is off target rather than the copy:
  @Prospecting Lead, please produce a written profile including disqualifiers and buying signals.
When a reply needs scoring, routing and a response commitment:
  @Revenue Operations Lead, please produce a lifecycle definition with stages, criteria and owners agreed in writing.

routing.growth-lead-magnet-builder:
# AGENTS

When captured leads need qualification before anyone calls them:
  @Revenue Operations Lead, please produce a lifecycle definition with stages, criteria and owners agreed in writing.

routing.growth-prospecting-lead:
# AGENTS

When the list is scored and every row carries a reason for inclusion:
  @Cold Email Writer, please produce a first-touch email with subject line and reasoning.
When a segment is worth reaching but is too early for direct outreach:
  @Lead Magnet Builder, please produce a format recommendation with the reasoning and the effort estimate.

routing.growth-revenue-operations-lead:
# AGENTS

When closed deals reveal a profile the list should have prioritised:
  @Prospecting Lead, please produce a written profile including disqualifiers and buying signals.
